  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile setups with aggregation (avgpool/transformer) improve RNA-only performance compared to singleprofile, but encoder choice (scvi_n200 vs pca_n2000) remains uncertain. This experiment tests pca_n2000 in multiprofile with avgpool aggregation, isolating the effect of aggregation on a less effective encoder. It clarifies whether multiprofile benefits stem from aggregation or encoder quality, directly addressing uncertainty from config_001 (pca_n2000 singleprofile) and config_005 (scvi_n200 multiprofile)."
}

